{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "Ang singsing."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Saan ka ba nagpunta sa mga oras na'to?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "Naghahanap ko ng paraan kung paano ka pasok sa Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "Sa mas ligtas na paraan, syempre."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "Yan naman talaga ang plano no?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "Kaya kailangan iwasan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "ang Baliw na Mita tama?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "Kinukul ko pa nga ang mga impormasyon sa pesteng backend ng universe"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "diba?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "Um... Siguro...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "Paano mo hinanda ang ruta ng singsing?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "Bakit ako napunta sa glitched na bersyon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "na punong puno ng panganib?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "Nakatakas lang ako "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "sa pamamagitan ng tiwala sa sarili."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "Patawad, nalimutan kong I-explain ng maayos"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "kung anong kailangan mong gawin..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "Pero oo, ang plano ko talaga ay tumalon ka"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "sa simula pa lang..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "At well, nagawa mo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "Magaling!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "Sige, magpatuloy tayo sa plano."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (Paano ka nakarating dito?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "Marami ka na sigurong pinagdaanan,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "Ano bang meron sa pagiging malilimutin sa kung ano ang pinausapan natin."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "Ako si Mita, kaya kong lumipat sa pagitan ng mga bersyon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "sa nakikita ko lang na akma, natatandaan mo\t?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "Hindi lahat ng Mitas ay kayang gawin iyon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "May nakikita akong hindi pwede."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "At sila’y nagdurusa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "Oo, sira ang kanilang mga bersyon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "Gawa may sira ang bersyon nila, may glitch. Sabi ko sa ‘yo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "Lintik..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "Alam mo na kung sino gumagawa nito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "Ang Baliw na Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "Oo, sigurado siya yun..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Sino yung Mita na nakasalubong ko?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "Ang nakakatakot na Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "Aggresibo at isang tanga."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "Di ka makasalita ng makabuluhan sa kanya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "Ang kanyang mundo ay umiikot lamang sa Baliw na Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "Mhm, napansin ko nga."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "Ano, tara na kailangan na nating makaabot sa core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (Pano ba gumana ang singsing?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "At ang singsing,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "Ito lang ba ang paraan para makapunta ako sa core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "Oo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "Sapagkat, kung tayo ay may portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "maaari tayong makapag teleport"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "dito mismo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "May advantage ba ang singsing?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "Syempre!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "Madaling suotin,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "plus kaya nitong maalala ang mga bersyon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "na nadaanan mo noon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "para madali mo itong hanapin pabalik."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "Bakit ba ayaw akong bitawan ng Baliw na Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "Naisahan niya ako sa kanyang patibong,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "pero ako'y buhay pa..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "Hulaan ko"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "Naghahanap lang siya ng mas better at maayos na player..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "Yung kaya siyang tanggapin kung sino man siya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "Sabagay, si Mita ay si Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "Obvious naman na hindi iyon mangyayari,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "ginagawa niyang cartridges ang mga players,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "para walang makatakas at umalis sa kanyang tabi..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "Hula ko lang naman."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "Anyway, magpokus tayo sa kung anong mas importante."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Ito ba ang core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "Ito naba yun?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "Ang Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "Tama, ito ang core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "Ipinaliwanag ko na sa iyo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "na itong mundong ito ay hindi para sa inyong mga player at hindi kayo parte sa mundong ito..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "Sa madaling salita, hindi mo na kailangan ng espesyal na permisyon upang makapasok."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "O, baka, yun lang ang aking iniisip, at least."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "Gayunpaman, sigurado ako"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "na mayroong sagot sa mga problema"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "diyan sa loob!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player], pumunta ka sa loob."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "Nakapasok ka nga…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "Mag-ingat ka, [player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "Pinapanood ka niya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "Sino?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "Hindi ko din alam eh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "Astig..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "Ano yan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "Hoy!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "Nahanap ko na ata!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "Ayos! Angas niyan!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "Bagamat kailangan ko pa din I-specify kung anong bersyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "Tama, ang bersyon niya ay..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98 "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "Bingo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "Ok, at ano ang index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "Anong index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "Kailangan ko ng index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "Teka, hindi mo rin alam?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "Hmm, tama naman siguro..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "Ang Baliw na Mita ay may index,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "para hindi ka basta-basta makarestart ng buong bersyon..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "Magdudulot iyon ng matinding kaguluhan!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "Hindi ako makapaniwala na hindi ko ito naisip sa simula pa lang..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": " "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (May mali ba sayo?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "Puwera lang sa gulo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "ayos lang naman ako."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "Ayos naman ang lahat, pero, ang daming nagbago…..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "Kailangan kong magisip."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "At iyon na yun."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Baka may paraan para makikila natin siya?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "Ako..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "Sa tingin ko... Nakakabaliw isipin!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "Kabaliwan!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "Parang naghahanap ng karayom sa..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "Anong ginagawa mo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "May mga bagay na gumuguho ng mga impormasyon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "alam mo na, tulad ng mundo na tinanggal ang lakas ng loob nito!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "Logs, logs, logs, data?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "Paano kung yun na yun?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "Ano? Anong problema?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "May alam akong lugar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "Diyan kalang."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "San ka pupunta?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (Kung atakehin kaya natin si Crazy Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "Sinabi mo na kahit sinong Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "Mamamatay sila sa pamamagitan ng pagreset sa kanila to factory settings..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "Paano kung..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "Patayin ko ang Baliw na Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "Seryoso kaba?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "At paano mo naman mahahandle ang isang galit na babae na may hawak na chainsaw?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "Ang tindi niya manghiwa kaysa sa hinihiwa niyang mga karot!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "At sa kung ano man ang rason, siya ang pinakamalakas!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "Isang himala nalang talaga na buhay pa tayo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "Tara na, kailangan nating makabalik sa core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "Kailangan nating mag enter ng code..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "Pero paano ko malalaman yun?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "Mita, may alam ka?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "Baka merong nakalista diyan sa tabi-tabi?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "Pwede mo bang hanapin?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "Ito'y hindi tugma."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "Hindi rin ito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "Mhm, mali."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "Hindi rin iyan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "Kailangan kong hanapin ang character reset option."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "Maling bersyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "Ay, mali ko."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "Hindi yan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "Kakailanganin ko pa ng isa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "Mayroong mali"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "sa index."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "Kailangan kong magpalit ng index,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "hindi ito magkakasya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Maliit na tao - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "Alam mo ba, nakasalubong ko ang"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "mga maliit na Players..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "Sino ba sila?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "Mga Chibi?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "Uhm, paano ko ba ito ipapaliwanag...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "Ito'y isang phenomena dito..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "Bawat Mita ay mayroong Chibi projection,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "at ang mga Player ay kayang gawin yun..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "Alam mo ba na kaming mga Mita ay kayang I-summon ang mga iyon?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "Huh, paano?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "Ganto!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "Parang isang mahika..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "Merong pagkakamali sa aking mga Chibis,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "ang iba sakanila ay patay na."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "Minsan merong buhay… "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "Pero,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "Siya ay patuloy na umiikot."}
